[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0010","text":"咲耶，能拍几张照片吗？\n想要几张新服装的照片"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0020","text":"嗯，当然可以\n没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0030","text":"那我拍了\n要上了──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0033","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0040","text":"——不愧是咲耶，完美无缺\n非常帅气"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0050","text":"呵呵，这种拍摄我已经习惯了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0060","text":"那最后一张，\n我想追加一个要求——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0070","text":"？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0080","text":"面向粉丝，来一张特别可爱的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0090","text":"哎呀哎呀……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600200_02_0100","text":"来了个不擅长的要求呢\n得打起精神来才行——"}]
